  unitName: Fire God Vargas
  unitId: 10014
  unitNumber: 4
  description: A swordsman from the ruined Agni Empire. As the battle with the gods
    began, he was at the front, cutting them down. His presence encouraged those
    terrified by the gods' strength, giving the humans a chance to counterattack.
    Continuing to lead the attack, Vargas, the savior of many, was counted as one
    of the Six Heroes and was feared by even the gods.
  summonDesc: You have summoned me.<br>Now show me what kind of <br>summoner you
    are!
  fusionDesc: More! Give me strength!<br>With this power we can take<br>on the gods!
  evoDesc: The gods are not to be feared!<br>Stick close to me!
  element: 1
  rarity: 4
